[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2790833440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105213#issuecomment-2790833440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105213","id":2790833440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mWL0g","user":{"login":"ibrahn","id":24498832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDk4ODMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24498832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn","html_url":"https://github.com/ibrahn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T19:49:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T19:49:41Z","body":"### Details\r\n\r\n`submenu_popup` here is already a `PopupMenu` so this cast is no longer necessary.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8598cd8e261716fa3addb6f10bb57c03a061be9/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L394-L398\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis code to select the next item has become a bit unwieldy and is reproduced verbatim for the gamepad event repeat.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8598cd8e261716fa3addb6f10bb57c03a061be9/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L494-L528\r\n\r\nI've replaced it, and the similar sections for selecting previous, with calls to simpler new functions that make use of the existing `set_focused_item`:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8ae6d74dbb12bfac25241d9fb54b719d46f66c8/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L453-L464\r\n\r\nSimilarly, here for the focus selection by text input, much of the state change can be done with `set_focused_item`:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8598cd8e261716fa3addb6f10bb57c03a061be9/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L748-L757\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHere `id` is not really concerned with an id and is just checking if there is a focused item that is enabled and not a separator:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8598cd8e261716fa3addb6f10bb57c03a061be9/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L764-L766\r\nSo it makes more sense to just make those checks explicit in the `if` condition.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe menu hiding in [`activate_item`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8598cd8e261716fa3addb6f10bb57c03a061be9/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L2699) repeats the same logic for this menu and its parents. This can just be a simple loop, now that we emit the `_pressed` signals _after_ all the hiding.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2790833440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849381651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105213#issuecomment-2849381651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105213","id":2849381651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p1h0T","user":{"login":"ibrahn","id":24498832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDk4ODMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24498832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn","html_url":"https://github.com/ibrahn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/gists{/gist_id}","starre